hand when dealing</font></b>

1193
01:27:51.170 --> 01:27:54.338
<b><font color="#ffff49">with defense contractors.</font></b>

1194
01:27:54.340 --> 01:27:57.108
<b><font color="#ffff49">I suppose.</font></b>

1195
01:27:57.110 --> 01:28:01.178
<b><font color="#ffff49">Is Alexis going to be
greedy too or a martyr?</font></b>

1196
01:28:01.180 --> 01:28:02.613
<b><font color="#ffff49">Well, she already</font></b>

1197
01:28:02.615 --> 01:28:04.749
<b><font color="#ffff49">has the diamonds, sir,
so if I'm not mistaken,</font></b>

1198
01:28:04.751 --> 01:28:07.418
<b><font color="#ffff49">I believe that she
just declared war.</font></b>

1199
01:28:07.420 --> 01:28:08.420
<b><font color="#ffff49">A martyr, then.</font></b>

1200
01:28:12.591 --> 01:28:17.061
<b><font color="#ffff49">You know what you have to
be to be a martyr, Doug?</font></b>

1201
01:28:17.063 --> 01:28:19.797
<b><font color="#ffff49">No, sir.</font></b>

1202
01:28:19.799 --> 01:28:20.799
<b><font color="#ffff49">Dead.</font></b>

